# Docker builds that use the repo root as context: deploy/Dockerfile.app (bapp
# web runtime image) and the legacy e2e web image (e2e/Dockerfile). Keep heavy
# or irrelevant dirs out of the build context. NOTE: do not exclude `dist/`
# (packages/bigtangle-ts/dist is a committed build the e2e image relies on) nor
# the root `web-build/` (deploy/Dockerfile.app packages it).

**/node_modules
.git
logs
notes
deploy/.image
e2e/web-build
e2e/demo-output
e2e/playwright-report
test-results
playwright-report
expo-app/.expo
expo-app/demo-output
*.log
